    <description>Quick Action: create an Opportunity linked to the current Case. Requires an Account on the Case. A Case with a Campaign (sales call-back) links the Opportunity to that campaign (CampaignId; in a staged campaign the Offer sister campaign) and names it after the campaign Callback Label; its campaign member then moves to the Offer campaign (Svc_CampaignMove).</description>
